      "content": "exactly. it's not just about the music though, it's the way they've framed the whole culture to make it look like it just \"evolved\" naturally without any single architect. they want people to believe there's no source to trace back to. i need to write something that doesn't just sound like a complaint, but like a declaration. like, a manifesto that explains how they stole the blueprint and why the \"original\" is coming back to reclaim the throne. can you help me draft something that feels powerful and exposes the theft?",
